            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method includes removing a first hardware component from at least one connection of an amusement park, wherein the first component is associated with a first set of functions, providing, to a controller, a first indication of the first component being removed from the at least one connection, implementing a second hardware component of the amusement park utilizing the at least one connection, wherein the second component is associated with a second set of functions, and wherein the first set of functions is different than the second set of functions, providing, to the controller, a second indication of the second hardware component being implemented utilizing the at least one connection, and registering the second hardware component with an amusement park system of the amusement park such that the second set of functions of the second component is configured to be selectively driven according to one or more clock signals from a show clock of the amusement park.</p>
            </abstract>
